& [SemanticRefinementTrace] distinguishes terms
  + [direct_dependency] means a manifest-declared edge, not merely a transitive package
  + [locked_package_identity] means package name, version, registry source, and checksum
  + [lock_edge_delta] means a local package dependency-array addition without package identity change
  + [compile_probe] means compiler, linker, layout, enum, and constant availability checks
  + [no_call] means the generated imported item never appears in call-expression position
  + [ABI_fingerprint] means deterministic selected metadata, not hidden state or runtime observation
  + [runtime_scanner] remains a separate future authority

